-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The tradespeople
--
-- `travel_radius_km` is left null on purpose: these people listed the areas
-- they work in, and a radius on top of that would quietly add areas nobody
-- named. The listed areas are the claim.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

